              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi, owesilisa noma owesifazane onomoya wemvelo yokuxhamazela noma umthakathi kumelwe nakanjani abulawe; kumelwe bakhandwe ngamatshe; igazi labo liyakuba phezu kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
